{
    "word": "curler",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                "word": "curler",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "43a653c3-9e7e-45c8-bf49-da8a0d4361a8",
                        "entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "curlers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b09fe935-f1f3-3582-b236-ac84b99a5fd0",
                        "entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One of a set of small cylindrical tubes used to curl hair."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5fc0eea-a8db-4d35-966e-e11fc3aea7d7",
                                "sense_id": "b09fe935-f1f3-3582-b236-ac84b99a5fd0",
                                "text": "Waiting for a girl who's got curlers in her hair / Waiting for a girl, she has no money anywhere"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c70573e-6175-4d8d-a5da-7e4124c267bb",
                                "sense_id": "b09fe935-f1f3-3582-b236-ac84b99a5fd0",
                                "text": "There was also hairdressing: hairdressing, too, really was hairdressing in those times — no running a comb through it and that was that. It was curled, frizzed, waved, put in curlers overnight, waved with hot tongs;[…]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "806389d2-8b4c-322a-9260-a81494eb9965",
                        "entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sportsman who plays curling."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dfc82c88-a13e-326e-97ee-61873d1dff09",
                        "entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pass or a shot of the ball which swerves."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "207ca68d-a2d1-4233-bed7-b6fe523ec236",
                                "sense_id": "dfc82c88-a13e-326e-97ee-61873d1dff09",
                                "text": "The captain sent a curler into the top corner of the net."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0223d36-8a4d-4d19-a517-b2dd2feaa0d5",
                                "sense_id": "dfc82c88-a13e-326e-97ee-61873d1dff09",
                                "text": "Lampard was replaced by Kalou but the substitute immediately gave the ball to Jonas, whose 25-yard curler was tipped wide by Cech."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc155799-e287-4ff5-a313-a55af0c126bc",
                                "sense_id": "dfc82c88-a13e-326e-97ee-61873d1dff09",
                                "text": "Liverpool were energised at the start of the second half, with ­Curtis Jones shaping a curler just past the far post."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d11b31ad-7438-3a51-973d-2de493e209c3",
                        "entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A wave which breaks with a barrel"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dc10204-8a06-4486-b54b-6964702b7284",
                                "sense_id": "d11b31ad-7438-3a51-973d-2de493e209c3",
                                "text": "Oft considered the most even playing field on which to measure surf mastery, Slater’s innovative machine is a barrel-synthesizing environment and engineering feat. In a single round, The Wave produces a 6-foot curler capable of traveling 2,300 feet for up to one gnarly minute."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e4c63c0e-7036-4e7b-9db1-1ea943e4f557",
                                "sense_id": "d11b31ad-7438-3a51-973d-2de493e209c3",
                                "text": "There’s the mesmeric, thrumming beat. (Sound very much “on” for this one.) Dark purples and roiling seas under heavy storms. Then Manuel, barreling perfect curler after perfect curler."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "394fd8ca-c3bf-4312-b9f8-db1899ddf6d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "39b95075-d55e-3112-aefa-3accd32cf0f8",
                        "source_sense_description": "sportsman",
                        "target_lang_word": "curler",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "curler",
